1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,126
Can you taste with your feet?

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:04,050
Butterflies can!

3
00:00:04,125 --> 00:00:06,432
Big secrets of tiny bugs!

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,199
A butterfly lands on a flower. Let's zoom in!

5
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:13,599
Tiny taste spots on its feet tell it right away:

6
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:16,190
Sweet! Time to eat!

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,311
What about crickets? Where are its ears?

8
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:23,548
On its head? Nope!

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,644
A cricket's ears are on its front legs!

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,571
Honeybees can't talk, so they dance!

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,915
The dance shows the way!

12
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,897
Six legs? In you go!

13
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:48,151
Go outside with a grown-up, and look closely!

14
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:50,279
Hey... is it tasting me?

15
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:52,000
Can YOUR feet taste?
